        <mxCell id="dashboard" value="TRANSCRIPTION_DASHBOARD&#xa;transcription_dashboard_v3&#xa;&#xa;Streamlit, warehouse runtime&#xa;12 modules under streamlit/&#xa;reads results + run status&#xa;uploads media &#183; fires the task" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#29B5E8;strokeColor=#11567F;fontColor=#000000;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1340" y="660" width="210" height="110" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="app-role" value="TRANSCRIPTION_APP_ROLE&#xa;&#xa;owner's rights: every viewer runs as this role&#xa;read-only on data &#183; OPERATE on task&#xa;READ,WRITE on AV stage&#xa;GRANT OWNERSHIP ON STREAMLIT is unsupported,&#xa;so the app is recreated AS this role" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#EDE7F6;strokeColor=#7254A3;fontColor=#000000;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=9;align=left;spacingLeft=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1120" y="800" width="430" height="90" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <!-- ===== Deprecated ===== -->
        <mxCell id="deprecated" value="DEPRECATED &#8212; keep suspended&#xa;&#xa;AV_STAGE_STREAM_V2&#xa;(never consumed &#8594; gate passed forever)&#xa;REFRESH_STAGE_DIRECTORY_TASK_V2&#xa;RUN_TRANSCRIPTION_NOTEBOOK()" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontColor=#666666;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=9;fontStyle=2;dashed=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="550" y="440" width="200" height="105" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <!-- ===== Hang annotation ===== -->
        <mxCell id="hang-note" value="KNOWN CONSTRAINT &#8212; snowbook shutdown hang&#xa;&#xa;EXECUTE NOTEBOOK is SYNCHRONOUS, so the task&#xa;blocks for the notebook's whole lifetime.&#xa;&#xa;On MULTI-FILE runs the notebook finishes every cell&#xa;and writes its rows, then snowbook's script runner&#xa;waits forever in on_scriptrunner_ready while the main&#xa;thread serves gRPC &#8594; ~8,100s transport timeout.&#xa;&#xa;0/8 single-file runs hung &#183; 6/8 multi-file runs hung&#xa;Root-caused 2026-08-19; re-confirmed on a LIVE hang&#xa;(11 dump cycles, zero notebook frames).&#xa;&#xa;WARNING: the 30-min task timeout caps the TASK,&#xa;NOT the container. A hung run leaks a GPU_NV_S&#xa;node INDEFINITELY - reclaim with&#xa;ALTER COMPUTE POOL ... STOP ALL.&#xa;&#xa;Transcripts always commit before the wedge;&#xa;this is a cost problem, not a data problem.&#xa;Fix: port to headless EXECUTE JOB SERVICE." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#EDE7F6;strokeColor=#7254A3;fontColor=#000000;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=9;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="800" y="440" width="270" height="205" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

